<title>UK: BayerLB sets 1.0 bln Ffr 15-year zero-coupon bond.</title>
<headline>BayerLB sets 1.0 bln Ffr 15-year zero-coupon bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager JP Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE LANDESBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN FFR   COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY   *14.NOV.11</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  36.35     PAY DATE    14.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25 BP     REOFFER    36.35     SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    TAX PROVS   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    15 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	* CALL OPTION AT 68.10 ON 14.NOV.06</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
